# Weather Dashboard - Vercel App

## Environment Variables (.env.local)

```env
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/verceldb?sslmode=require
```

Replace with your actual Vercel PostgreSQL credentials.

## Local Development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
# Open http://localhost:3000
```

## Deployment

1. Push to GitHub
2. Import in Vercel dashboard
3. Add DATABASE_URL environment variable
4. Deploy!
